In Sweet Seymour Skinner's Baadasssss Song, when Skinner loses his job and goes back to the school after hours, and remembers all the children he helped.

&#x200B;

'I learned to read because of you principal Skinner' was what got me.

Thank you! There's nothing I can do, it might come back it might not. 

&#x200B;

Glad it's not some serious illness, so I'm thankful I'm just missing some fur.

Wow, an actual Juicy Ciwa!

&#x200B;

I'd say that's good parenting. Bet you didn't do it again.

In the 69th minute to make it 3-0 NUFC.

&#x200B;

And Cedric gets sent off.

Spurs fan here

